Project Planning

Project Development Plan

Phase 1 – Brainstorming and Ideation

Identify the problem, project idea, objectives, and expected outcome.

Phase 2 – Requirement Analysis

Identify the functional, non-functional, software, and hardware requirements.

Phase 3 – Project Design

Design the system architecture, workflow, and project modules.

Phase 4 – Project Planning

Prepare the development schedule and assign tasks to team members.

Phase 5 – Project Development

Develop the ticket classification system and integrate the required technologies.

Phase 6 – Project Testing

Test the system using different types of support tickets.

Phase 7 – Project Documentation

Prepare the complete project report and supporting documents.

Phase 8 – Project Demonstration

Demonstrate the working project and explain the final output.

Tools and Technologies

- Python
- Machine Learning
- Natural Language Processing
- VS Code / Jupyter Notebook
- Database
